      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a bit too brief though... can you expand on the \"harming consumers\" part? like, what are the actual specific things critics say are happening to people or small businesses because these companies are so big? also, try to give me some more detail on the industry side's defense so it looks professional.",
